<title>GREECE: PUBLIC PROSECUTOR TO PROBE MEGA TV IPO.</title>
<headline>PUBLIC PROSECUTOR TO PROBE MEGA TV IPO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Public prosecutor Isaac Doyiakos has laid felony charges against anyone responsible in connection with the listing of Mega Channel - Teletypos on the Athens bourse, court sources said.</p>
<p>The case will be assigned to a prosecuting investigator who will look into charges that the share price of the initial public offering was based on a fictitious balance sheet. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
